flowchart TB
 B[浏览器 Vue3] --> G[反向代理 HTTPS]
 G --> A[FastAPI HTTP + WebSocket]
 A --> D[(PostgreSQL)]
 A --> R[(Redis 缓存/广播)]
 M[行情Worker] --> X[ExchangeAdapter]
 C[账户同步Worker] --> X
 E[交易执行Worker] --> X
 X --> EX[Binance / Bitget / OKX]
 M --> R
 C --> D
 E --> D
 D --> O[事务Outbox分发]
 O --> N[告警/通知Worker]
 O --> A
 S[隔离策略Worker] --> I[Intent + 风控入口]
 I --> D
